# DEKIT: Premium Shirts Web Application

The goal is to build a premium website for "DEKIT", a business selling classic shirts. The website will feature a unique visual style combining a white, pale yellow, and lavender theme with glassmorphism and claymorphism effects, highlighted by a dynamic 3D/4D tesseract shirt viewer.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The design calls for a highly specialized "switching of shirts on tesseract" 3D/4D view. I will implement a dynamic wireframe Tesseract (4D hypercube) using `Three.js` via `@react-three/fiber`, where the different shirts (generated via AI for demo purposes) will rotate and switch at the focal points of the tesseract. 
> Please review if this approach meets your vision for the "3D + 4D view".

